  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。充滿愛打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>Giant Spawn 是一款極簡且可自訂設定的模組，允許巨人自然生成。當殭屍生成時，它有一定機率成為巨人，預設機率為 1/20，且僅限於地表生成。此模組還基於殭屍的 AI 為巨人添加了自訂 AI。<br><br></p>\n<p>您也可能對&nbsp;<span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/skeleton-horse-spawn\"><strong>骷髏馬生成</strong></a>&nbsp;</span>或&nbsp;<span><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/zombie-horse-spawn\">殭屍馬生成</a></strong></span>感興趣。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/spawn-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的生成模組包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"運行環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可自訂設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>展開詳情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>chanceSurfaceZombieIsGiant</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 0.05，最小值 0，最大值 1.0<br>在地表生成的殭屍成為巨人的機率。<br><br><span><strong>shouldBurnGiantsInDaylight</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true<br>若啟用，白天陽光直射時會使巨人燃燒。<br><br><span><strong>onlySpawnGiantOnSurface</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true<br>若啟用，巨人將僅在地表生成。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>giantMovementSpeedModifier</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 1.0，最小值 0，最大值 20.0<br>巨人移動速度相對於基礎殭屍移動速度的修正倍率。<br><br><span><strong>giantAttackDamageModifier</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 2.0，最小值 0，最大值 20.0<br>巨人攻擊傷害相對於基礎殭屍攻擊傷害的修正倍率。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>巨人使用自訂 AI 移動：<br></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/giant-spawn/a.webp\" alt=\"巨人移動\" width=\"1000\" height=\"540\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可在任何模組包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
